field.description:
Kerberos is preferred. Kerberos + NTLM offers an explicitly enabled legacy fallback. NTLM-only is intended for
appliances that cannot use SPNEGO/Kerberos. Enforce NTLMv2 and reject LM/NTLMv1 in Active Directory policy;
a domain member cannot override what the DC accepts for domain accounts. Basic validates against the selected server.
